      "title": "AI for the Common Good",
      "description": "The \"AI for the Common Good\" initiative proposes harnessing advanced artificial intelligence resources to drive optimal, data-driven decision-making across public administration and community development. By deploying ethical algorithms to analyze complex datasets, municipal and global leaders can anticipate resource shortages, streamline service delivery, and target interventions where they are needed most. This framework ensures that technological power is directly channeled into solving systemic social challenges rather than commercial pursuits. Ultimately, the initiative bridges the gap between raw data and actionable human welfare, fostering transparent and highly effective governance for society.",
      "status": "proposal",
      "lifecyclePhase": "projected",
      "visibility": {
        "policy": "public"
      },
