    "initiative-1785948978037": {
      "initiativeId": "initiative-1785948978037",
      "stewardId": "5bb8e373-c042-4786-a69c-0340301711d8",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-05T16:56:18.037Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-05T17:15:13.468Z",
      "title": "Development of the Humanity Union platform",
      "description": "An interactive, multi-stakeholder platform that provides citizens with transparent access to government decision-making processes, policy tracking, and collaborative forums. The platform utilizes fact-based education to dismantle the \"ignorance trap\"—the lack of accessible information that often fuels political polarization, inequality, and corruption. Core Objectives\nThe Humanity Union aims to transform the relationship between the governed and the governing by shifting from passive observation to active, informed participation. By creating a standardized, transparent record of political activities, the platform minimizes the space where corruption thrives and empowers citizens to replace cynicism with data-driven advocacy.\n\nStrategic Impact\nCombating Ignorance: By centralizing verified data and policy history, the platform removes barriers to understanding complex government actions.\n\nMitigating Aggression: Structured, moderated dialogue spaces encourage deliberation over reaction, reducing the hostility often found in fragmented online political spaces.\n\nReducing Inequality: Transparent budget tracking ensures that public resources are visible to all, holding institutions accountable for equitable distribution.",
      "status": "proposal",
      "lifecyclePhase": "projected",
      "visibility": {
        "policy": "public"
      },
